<metadata><name>Day 69 - Malcolm Bluff, Bob Light, Coveney's</name></metadata>
<wpt lat="44.862611" lon="-81.067962"><name>P Start/finish parking</name><desc>Roadside Parking at the bend on the grassy shoulder of Coveney's Rd. Free</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.873790" lon="-81.075040"><name>P2 alternative parking</name><desc>Crooked Toe Parking: Courtesy of Chippewas of Nawash. Free. Joins the route near km 12.3 (1160 m walk).</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.861375" lon="-81.061869"><name>J1</name><desc>J1: Turn right onto the white-blazed main Bruce Trail, heading east. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off on your left.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.858536" lon="-81.050716"><name>J2</name><desc>J2: Turn right onto the blue-blazed Bob Light Side Trail, heading south-east. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off ahead.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.853041" lon="-81.038207"><name>J3</name><desc>J3: Turn right onto the blue-blazed Malcolm Bluff Side Trail, heading west. (the blue-blazed Bob Light Side Trail goes off on your left.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.846856" lon="-81.059829"><name>J4</name><desc>J4: Turnaround point. Turn around and retrace your steps.</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.849739" lon="-81.032498"><name>J5</name><desc>J5: Turnaround point. The side trail meets the white-blazed main Bruce Trail here. Turn around and retrace your steps.</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.862497" lon="-81.067946"><name>J6</name><desc>J6: You pass the start again. Keep going on the blue-blazed Coveney's Side Trail, heading north.</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.867429" lon="-81.070459"><name>J7</name><desc>J7: Turnaround point. The side trail meets the white-blazed main Bruce Trail here. Turn around and retrace your steps.</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
